sevenance-by-joga for Debian
---------------------------

The upstream archive (sevenance.zip from scene.org) has been repackaged
without the zip wrapper.

The party executable was a self-extracting compressed binary (4864 bytes);
the unpacked ELF is shipped instead. It has no section headers, so
dh_strip, dh_dwz, dh_makeshlibs and dh_shlibdeps are disabled and the runtime
dependencies (libsdl2-2.0-0, libgl1) are declared by hand in
debian/control. Lintian reports it as statically linked: this is a false
positive, overridden.

executable seems to be compiled for an unknown distribution (no compiler
signature left in the size-optimized binary)

Source files:
-------------
(none listed, the binary has no section headers)

